  "title": "Gluten-Free Blueberry Crisp",
  "description": "This quick and easy blueberry crisp is gluten-free and needs only a handful of ingredients like ready-made blueberry filling, gluten-free cake mix, and gluten-free oats.",
  "authors": [
    "thedailygourmet"
  ],
